(F5 T2 V5: element_dof (manual Professional 6.421, unknowns per element
 in the element nodes, node-major, nnol*nuknwn values) of two quad4 2x2
 Gauss, 10 unknowns: 40 values per element. Source: Professional
 02-08-2026 probe two (same input). The stresses are the PER-ELEMENT nodal
 recovery of the integration-point values (they differ from the averaged
 node_dof at the shared nodes 2 and 5, e.g. sigxx node 2: element 1
 -1.6178, element 2 -3.0275, node_dof -2.3227); velx/vely are the node
 values. Every slot equals the Professional within 1e-11 except
 disx/disy (Professional 0, GNU the recovery of the integration-point
 displacement; class B ELEMENT-DOF-DISPLACEMENT). Expected lines in
 scripts/build_safe.sh: Professional values with the GNU displacement
 slots; tolerance 1e-5 of the largest value.)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 2
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
materi_stress
end_initia
node 1 0 0
node 2 1 0
node 3 2 0
node 4 0 1
node 5 1 1
node 6 2 1
element 1 -quad4 1 2 4 5
element 2 -quad4 2 3 5 6
group_type 0 -materi
group_materi_memory 0 -total_linear
group_materi_elasti_young 0 1000.
group_materi_elasti_poisson 0 0.3
bounda_dof 0 -ra 1 4 -ra -velx -vely
bounda_dof 2 2 -vely
bounda_dof 1 6 -velx
bounda_time 1 0.01
control_timestep 0 1. 1.
end_data
